<title>NORWAY: Hydro,Aker Maritime in NOK 1 bln dispute.</title>
<headline>Hydro,Aker Maritime in NOK 1 bln dispute.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norsk Hydro ASA said on Tuesday it had received a claim from Aker Stord, a unit of Aker Maritime ASA, for about one billion crowns more than the agreed price in connection with Aker's work on the Njord oil production platform.</p>
<p>Hydro, which is operator for the Njord oilfield, said the claim included an earlier warning which amounted to about half of the sum.</p>
</text>
